---
/**
 * The lifecycle of one inbound message: policy, debounce, agent run, event
 * folding, card rendering, final answer and persistence.
 */
---
<figure class="nb-diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 590" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc" style="width:100%;height:auto">
    <title id="flow-title">Message lifecycle</title>
    <desc id="flow-desc">A message passes through access policy and a debounce queue, starts or resumes an agent, streams events, updates a card, then produces a final answer and persists state.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="flow-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif">
      <g font-size="17">
        <rect x="20" y="45" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-brand-wash)" stroke="var(--nb-brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="120" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">1. Message arrives</text>
        <text x="120" y="99" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">DM, group, topic,</text>
        <text x="120" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">comment or meeting</text>

        <rect x="260" y="45" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-card)" stroke="var(--nb-border-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="360" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">2. Access + mention</text>
        <text x="360" y="99" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">allowlists, admins,</text>
        <text x="360" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">group @-mention</text>

        <rect x="500" y="45" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-card)" stroke="var(--nb-border-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="600" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">3. Debounce + queue</text>
        <text x="600" y="99" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">merge bursts; persist</text>
        <text x="600" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">pending.json with TTL</text>

        <rect x="740" y="45" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-brand-wash)" stroke="var(--nb-brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="840" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">4. Run agent</text>
        <text x="840" y="99" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">resume or start; wait</text>
        <text x="840" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">for a concurrency slot</text>
      </g>

      <line x1="220" y1="90" x2="260" y2="90" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
      <line x1="460" y1="90" x2="500" y2="90" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
      <line x1="700" y1="90" x2="740" y2="90" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />

      <line x1="840" y1="135" x2="840" y2="235" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />

      <g font-size="17">
        <rect x="740" y="235" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-card)" stroke="var(--nb-border-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="840" y="265" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">5. Agent events</text>
        <text x="840" y="289" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">text, reasoning, tools,</text>
        <text x="840" y="306" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">permissions, questions</text>

        <rect x="500" y="235" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-card)" stroke="var(--nb-border-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="600" y="265" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">6. Fold RunView</text>
        <text x="600" y="289" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">ordered text and tools;</text>
        <text x="600" y="306" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">pause on a decision</text>

        <rect x="260" y="235" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-card)" stroke="var(--nb-border-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="360" y="265" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">7. Stream card</text>
        <text x="360" y="289" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">CardKit updates; roll</text>
        <text x="360" y="306" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">over before 8.5 minutes</text>

        <rect x="20" y="235" width="200" height="90" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-success-muted)" stroke="var(--nb-success)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="120" y="265" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">8. Final answer</text>
        <text x="120" y="289" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">latest card or text;</text>
        <text x="120" y="306" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">stop button removed</text>
      </g>

      <line x1="740" y1="280" x2="700" y2="280" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
      <line x1="500" y1="280" x2="460" y2="280" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
      <line x1="260" y1="280" x2="220" y2="280" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />

      <rect x="500" y="365" width="440" height="58" rx="10" fill="var(--nb-warning-muted)" stroke="var(--nb-warning)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <text x="720" y="389" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="650" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">Approval or question: step 6 pauses</text>
      <text x="720" y="408" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">a card click resumes the same run; ten minutes without one denies it</text>
      <line x1="720" y1="325" x2="720" y2="365" stroke="var(--nb-warning)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4 4" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />

      <line x1="120" y1="325" x2="120" y2="430" stroke="var(--nb-muted-foreground)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />

      <rect x="20" y="430" width="440" height="85" rx="12" fill="var(--nb-muted)" stroke="var(--nb-border)" />
      <text x="240" y="461" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="var(--nb-foreground)">9. Persist and continue</text>
      <text x="240" y="484" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">sessions.json and pending.json are updated; the next queued</text>
      <text x="240" y="501" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--nb-muted-foreground)">batch starts as a new turn. A crash restores the queue at startup.</text>

    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>One message is one turn. The queue is durable across restarts; approvals and questions pause the run without releasing its concurrency slot.</figcaption>
</figure>
